# Astan – Account and Data Deletion

This page explains how users can request the deletion of their **Astan** account and associated data.

## Request Account Deletion

If you would like to delete your Astan account and its data, please send a request email.

**Email:** [contact.astan@gmail.com](mailto:contact.astan@gmail.com)
**Subject:** Account Deletion Request

Please include the following information in your message:

* Your Astan account username and ID
* The email address or phone number associated with the account

## What Data Will Be Deleted

When your request is processed, the following information will be permanently deleted:

* Profile information
* Posts, ideas, and projects created by the account
* Messages and interactions
* Account identifiers

## Data Retention

Some data may remain in secure backups for a limited period of time (up to 30 days) before being permanently removed.

## Processing Time

Account deletion requests are typically processed within **7 days** of receiving the request.

## Contact

If you have questions regarding your data or privacy, please contact:

